<title>UK: Austria sets 100 mln mark 10-year fix/reverse FRN.</title>
<headline>Austria sets 100 mln mark 10-year fix/reverse FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Morgan Stanley Bank AG.</p>
<p> BORROWER   REPUBLIC OF AUSTRIA</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON   **9.0	 MATURITY    21.MAY.07</p>
<p> TYPE   FIX/REV FRN   ISS PRICE  101.625   PAY DATE    21.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 REOFFER    PAR	 SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  GOV LAW     GERMAN</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  1/625     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES    **UNTIL 1999, THEN 16.5 PCT LESS 2 TIMES 6M LIBOR</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
